  "message": "Based on the promotional offers in our records, the strongest sign-up bonus by dollar value is the Silver Rewards Card: a $500 statement credit after $2,000 in eligible purchases within the first month. However, that offer was only available for accounts opened from January 1 through June 30, 2025, so it is no longer available.

The currently listed personal-card option is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 as a statement or checking-account credit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during the first month. It has no stated credit-score requirement, but it carries a $50 annual fee and a 19.99% purchase APR.

If you are considering a business card, the Silver Zoom Card lists triple cash back for nine months after opening, provided the offer is claimed by December 31, 2025. Since promotional availability can change, check the application page for the offer displayed at the time you apply.

For your priority—maximizing the initial bonus—the EcoCard is the only listed personal sign-up bonus I found that remains within its stated promotional window. I would avoid carrying a balance, since interest could quickly outweigh the bonus."
}
